T*
/F1 11 Tf
(reading level. Common substitutions:) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(  randomized       ->  assigned by chance, like a coin toss) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(  adverse event    ->  a health problem during the study) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(  placebo          ->  a look-alike with no medicine in it) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(  discontinue      ->  stop) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
